  "Id": 2760,
  "Title": "Breast Cancer Awareness Gala",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "An awareness gala was organised to raise awareness regarding breast cancer and its prevention in the community.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Aga Khan Health board for Karimabad organised\nan awareness gala in collaboration with the Aga Khan Health Service, Pakistan\nto raise awareness regarding breast cancer and its prevention in the community."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\nCIME in collaboration with SPIE, contributed by demonstrating the steps of breast\nself-examination using the task-trainer\nto the women of the community. The gala was a huge success and was attended by\nover 700 people. "
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The breast self-examination station gathered the most\nattention and received positive feedback from participants as they practiced\nthe self-breast examination techniques and got feedback from the experts.\n\n\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
